{start_of_intro: Intro}
[E/G#]  [A]  [C#m]  [B]  [E/G#]  [A]  [C#m]  [B]
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain 1}
[E/G#]Ri[A]sen, He's [C#m]ri[B]sen,
For[E/G#]ever [A]glorified[C#m] [B]
[E/G#]Ri[A]sen, He's [C#m]ri[B]sen,
King [E/G#]Je[A]sus, King [C#m]Jesus [B]is alive
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_intro: Interlude 1}
[E/G#]  [A]  [C#m]  [B]  [E/G#]  [A]  [C#m]  [B]
[E/G#] [A]Oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah, [E/G#] [A]oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah
[E/G#] [A]Oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah, [E/G#] [A]oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Couplet}
[C#m]Grave where [E/G#]are you [A]now, [(A)]you've been [E]over[B]powered
[C#m]Death where [B/D#]is [E]your [A]sting, [(A)]conquered [E/G#]by the [B]King
[C#m]Resur[E/G#]rected [A]one, [(A)]shining [E]like the [B]sun
[C#m]Breaking [B/D#]through [E]the [A]fear, vic[(A)]tory is [E/G#]here, [B]victory is here
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_prechorus: Pré-Refrain}
[E] Oh, oh, hallelujah, oh, oh, hallelujah
[A]Jesus be lifted higher, we serve a risen Savior
{end_of_prechorus}


{start_of_intro: Interlude 2}
[E/G#] [A]Oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah, [E/G#] [A]oh, [C#m]oh, halle[B]lujah[A]
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Couplet 2}
[C#m]Resur[E/G#]rected [A]one, [(A)]shining [E]like the [B]sun
[C#m]Breaking [B/D#]through [E]the [A]fear, vic[(A)]tory is [E/G#]here, [B]victory is here
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_chorus: Refrain 2}
